# PodBox - while playing screen, 480x640 (Surfans F20 Pro+)
# Dark, flat cards with shadows, Inter. Cards and shadows are baked into
# the backdrop (podbox/theme/mkassets.py, which holds the same layout
# numbers). No %s (scrolling): long texts are cut off.
%wd
%X(wps-backdrop.bmp)

%Fl(2,36-Inter-Bold.fnt)
%Fl(3,28-Inter-Medium.fnt)
%Fl(4,24-Inter.fnt)
%Fl(5,22-Inter-SemiBold.fnt)
%Fl(6,44-Inter-Bold.fnt)
%Fl(7,28-Inter-SemiBold.fnt)

%xl(none,cover-none.bmp,0,0)
%xl(pbtrack,pb-track.bmp,0,0)
%xl(playmode,st-playmode.bmp,0,0,3)
%xl(shuf,st-shuffle.bmp,0,0)
%xl(repeat,st-repeat.bmp,0,0,3)
%xl(battery,st-battery.bmp,0,0,11)
%xl(vcard,vol-card.bmp,0,0)
%xl(vicon,vol-icon.bmp,0,0)
%xl(voltrack,vol-track.bmp,0,0)

%Cl(0,0,256,256,c,c)

%?C<%Vd(art)|%Vd(noart)>
# volume overlay for 2 s after the volume changed (wheel)
%?mv(2.0)<%Vd(v)|%Vd(p)>

#
# status bar
#
%V(16,7,20,20,-)
%?mp<%xd(playmode,3)|%xd(playmode,1)|%xd(playmode,2)|%xd(playmode,1)|%xd(playmode,1)|%xd(playmode,3)|%xd(playmode,3)|%xd(playmode,3)|%xd(playmode,3)>
%V(42,7,20,20,-)
%?ps<%xd(shuf)|>
%V(66,7,20,20,-)
%?mm<|%xd(repeat,1)|%xd(repeat,2)|%xd(repeat,3)|%xd(repeat,1)>
%V(140,5,200,23,5)
%ac%?mS<SPULEN|%?cc<%?ca<%?St(time format)<%cH|%cI>:%cM|>|>>
%V(316,5,114,23,5)%Vf(A8ACB0)
%ar%bl %%
%V(436,8,28,16,-)
%?bl<%xd(battery,1)|%xd(battery,1)|%xd(battery,2)|%xd(battery,3)|%xd(battery,4)|%xd(battery,5)|%xd(battery,6)|%xd(battery,7)|%xd(battery,8)|%xd(battery,9)|%xd(battery,10)|%xd(battery,11)>

#
# cover
#
%Vl(art,112,46,256,256,-)
%Cd
%Vl(noart,112,46,256,256,-)
%xd(none)

#
# title, artist, album
#
%V(24,314,432,38,2)
%ac%?it<%it|%fn>
%V(24,354,432,29,3)%Vf(A8ACB0)
%ac%?ia<%ia|%?iA<%iA|%?d(2)<%d(2)|>>>
%V(24,386,432,25,4)%Vf(84888E)
%ac%?id<%id|%?d(1)<%d(1)|>>%?iy< · %iy|>

#
# progress card, next track
#
%Vl(p,44,446,392,6,-)
%pb(0,0,392,6,pb-fill.bmp,backdrop,pbtrack)
%Vl(p,44,463,392,23,5)%Vf(A8ACB0)
%al%pc%ac%fc · %fk kHz%ar-%pr
%Vl(p,24,528,310,23,5)%Vf(84888E)
ALS NÄCHSTES
%Vl(p,24,553,310,25,4)%Vf(A8ACB0)
%?It<%It|%Fn>%?Ia< – %Ia|>
%Vl(p,344,540,112,23,5)%Vf(A8ACB0)
%ac%pp / %pe

#
# volume overlay (an opaque image over the lower part)
#
%Vl(v,0,418,480,222,-)
%xd(vcard)
%Vl(v,44,452,40,40,-)
%xd(vicon)
%Vl(v,94,458,200,29,7)
%Vs(fill,2A2E33,E8ECF0)Lautstärke
%Vl(v,250,450,136,45,6)
%Vs(fill,2A2E33,E8ECF0)%ar%pv
%Vl(v,390,462,50,25,4)
%Vs(fill,2A2E33,84888E)%al / 30
%Vl(v,44,534,392,14,-)
%pv(0,0,392,14,vol-fill.bmp,backdrop,voltrack)
